1
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,799
The red thread of the God of Marriage ties you together.

2
00:00:35,079 --> 00:00:36,359
You are destined to be together.

3
00:00:36,679 --> 00:00:38,840
Wish Your Majesty a son soon.

4
00:00:39,119 --> 00:00:40,840
Wish you longevity and prosperity.

5
00:00:46,759 --> 00:00:47,640
Thank you, Your Majesty.

6
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:02,920
Feng Zhiwei,

7
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:05,959
I never thought

8
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:08,359
I would want to marry someone.

9
00:01:14,719 --> 00:01:15,879
After drinking this cup of wine,

10
00:01:17,079 --> 00:01:17,959
from now on,

11
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:20,920
we are husband and wife.

12
00:01:36,519 --> 00:01:36,920
You...

13
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:39,200
I cherished you like a treasure,

14
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:42,280
why did you treat me like this?

15
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:45,920
Ye Xuan,

16
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:49,640
you thief who stole the body.

17
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:51,840
It's time

18
00:01:52,879 --> 00:01:54,000
to put everything in its place.

19
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:00,359
It was Gu Jichen who stole the body

20
00:02:01,599 --> 00:02:03,159
for years.

21
00:02:04,359 --> 00:02:05,319
Feng Zhiwei,

22
00:02:06,519 --> 00:02:08,319
why do you treat me like this?

23
00:03:17,599 --> 00:03:18,879
Where is this place?

24
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:23,800
Fu Yi,

25
00:03:24,479 --> 00:03:25,759
you're surprisingly quiet today.

26
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:36,199
This enchantment

27
00:04:36,879 --> 00:04:37,399
can bring Gu Jiachen back

28
00:04:37,399 --> 00:04:38,399
by killing

29
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:39,879
the rest of us.

30
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:42,120
Now the Hulian army is approaching.

31
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:44,399
Before the war breaks out,

32
00:04:45,199 --> 00:04:46,519
it's the best way

33
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,160
to let him deal with it.

34
00:04:54,079 --> 00:04:55,480
I spent a day with you,

35
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:59,360
and I won't regret it.

36
00:05:06,199 --> 00:05:07,079
Feng Zhiwei,

37
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:11,600
for Gu Jiachen,

38
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:15,439
you can even give up Fu Yi.

39
00:05:21,399 --> 00:05:22,279
What about me?

40
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:27,079
I'm not worth mentioning.

41
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,079
Lady Feng,

42
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,839
since you have a way

43
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:40,120
to bring back His Highness,

44
00:05:40,879 --> 00:05:43,120
After the Hulian clan rises in rebellion,

45
00:05:43,519 --> 00:05:44,480
when His Highness returns,

46
00:05:45,399 --> 00:05:46,639
everything will be resolved.

47
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,079
I never thought

48
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,199
the Qinglou State

49
00:05:49,519 --> 00:05:51,120
has such advanced sorcery.

50
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:53,279
Yexuan doesn't know about this.

51
00:05:54,319 --> 00:05:55,839
Don't let slip a word.

52
00:05:57,519 --> 00:05:59,000
We bought his favorite meal

53
00:05:59,079 --> 00:06:00,360
for this ancestor today.

54
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:02,120
I hope he won't shout for killing

55
00:06:02,199 --> 00:06:03,160
when he attends the court tomorrow.

56
00:06:04,319 --> 00:06:06,040
Did you use such little kindness

57
00:06:06,439 --> 00:06:08,240
to coax Fu Yi to death?

58
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:09,720
Feng Zhiwei,

59
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,279
I've been curious.

60
00:06:13,519 --> 00:06:14,600
What does the rise and fall of Li

61
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:16,000
have to do

62
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,279
with a woman

63
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:18,800
from Qinglou?

64
00:06:19,759 --> 00:06:20,879
What are you talking about?

65
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:25,639
You've been saying

66
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:26,879
you're here to help me

67
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:28,319
with the court affairs.

68
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:29,759
But in fact,

69
00:06:30,839 --> 00:06:31,519
you just want to find

70
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,959
an excuse to kill me

71
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,519
and Fu Yi,

72
00:06:36,639 --> 00:06:38,040
to get Gu back.

73
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:41,360
It's not what you think.

74
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:43,120
Your Majesty.

75
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:43,759
Get away!

76
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,839
You are a lackey of Gu Jichen.

77
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:52,040
You finally found an excuse

78
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:53,839
for the He Lian Army.

79
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:55,040
What?

80
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:57,000
You think I can't handle it

81
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:59,360
and it must be Gu Jichen?

82
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:02,040
I shouldn't have been soft on you.

83
00:07:08,199 --> 00:07:09,360
Yexuan, listen to me.

84
00:07:09,399 --> 00:07:09,959
What?

85
00:07:10,759 --> 00:07:11,959
Tell me how you brought him back

86
00:07:12,519 --> 00:07:13,360
and helped him kill me.

87
00:07:14,079 --> 00:07:14,639
I didn't.

88
00:07:18,959 --> 00:07:19,439
You didn't?

89
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:23,800
Then what's this?

90
00:07:27,519 --> 00:07:28,319
As expected,

91
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:31,360
liars always love to argue.

92
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:35,279
Yexuan, what are you doing?

93
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:36,319
What are you doing?

94
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:39,720
You like Gu Jianchen the most, don't you?

95
00:07:40,319 --> 00:07:41,079
You're willing to kill me

96
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:41,879
for him, aren't you?

97
00:07:42,879 --> 00:07:44,240
Now I want to see

98
00:07:44,319 --> 00:07:45,800
when he appears in front of you next time,

99
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:46,759
do you still have the face

100
00:07:46,759 --> 00:07:47,720
to stand in front of him?

101
00:07:50,199 --> 00:07:51,439
Yexuan, are you crazy?

102
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:20,560
About Fu Yi,

103
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:22,000
it's not what you think.

104
00:08:23,639 --> 00:08:24,720
At this point,

105
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:27,959
why would you still lie to me?

106
00:08:37,879 --> 00:08:38,639
From today on,

107
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,279
stay here.

108
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:45,759
Don't leave the palace.

109
00:08:49,399 --> 00:08:49,879
Ye Xuan.

110
00:08:50,519 --> 00:08:51,000
Ye Xuan.

111
00:08:51,759 --> 00:08:52,240
Don't expect

112
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:53,320
Shen Li to let you go.

113
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:55,600
If anyone lets you out,

114
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,679
I'll kill him.

115
00:08:59,519 --> 00:09:00,720
So annoying.

116
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:01,559
So annoying.

117
00:09:02,559 --> 00:09:03,120
You...

118
00:09:12,559 --> 00:09:13,799
Why is it getting lighter?

119
00:09:18,919 --> 00:09:19,320
Your Highness,

120
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:20,480
the Helian clan is approaching,

121
00:09:20,879 --> 00:09:21,799
and our troops are ready.

122
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:22,919
But this year's drought

123
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,200
has caused a food shortage.

124
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:26,639
If we fight, we don't have enough supplies.

125
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:27,759
If we don't,

126
00:09:28,639 --> 00:09:29,600
the border is in crisis.

127
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:31,200
The Ministry of Civil Office

128
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:33,200
can't come up with a solution.

129
00:09:34,559 --> 00:09:35,799
If we can't win, we shouldn't fight.

130
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:38,120
We should hold the border and survive the winter,

131
00:09:38,559 --> 00:09:39,759
then launch a counterattack

132
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,200
next year when the harvest comes.

133
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,320
Avoid their momentum,

134
00:09:44,799 --> 00:09:46,000
attack when they're worn out.

135
00:09:46,639 --> 00:09:48,840
This is indeed the safest approach.

136
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:49,559
But...

137
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:51,120
But this will be tough for the front line.

138
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:52,159
200,000 soldiers and civilians,

139
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:54,159
this winter

140
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:56,159
will surely cost them dearly.

141
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:57,919
You may leave now.

142
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:16,639
Feng Zhiwei,

143
00:10:18,879 --> 00:10:20,240
you thought I can't do anything

144
00:10:21,399 --> 00:10:23,039
to the He Lian army

145
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:23,799
without Gu Jiachen?

146
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:34,559
Well,

147
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:36,600
what did the doctor say

148
00:10:37,519 --> 00:10:38,559
about her hand?

149
00:10:39,679 --> 00:10:40,720
It's just a flesh wound.

150
00:10:41,639 --> 00:10:42,759
But the Imperial Kitchen said

151
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,720
she hasn't eaten a bite.

152
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:45,960
If this continues,

153
00:10:46,639 --> 00:10:47,320
it won't be good.

154
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:49,639
She's not eating?

155
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,399
She can eat or not.

156
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,639
There are plenty of others who will.

157
00:10:55,679 --> 00:10:56,000
You...

158
00:10:56,679 --> 00:10:57,240
Pass my order.

159
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:58,919
If she refuses to eat again,

160
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:01,000
all who serve her

161
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,600
will be executed together.

162
00:11:03,879 --> 00:11:04,559
If that's the case,

163
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:07,399
Lady Feng might get angry.

164
00:11:10,679 --> 00:11:11,440
Angry?

165
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:14,120
She seems to have forgotten

166
00:11:14,159 --> 00:11:15,159
her current situation.

167
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,159
Why should I care

168
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,200
about her thoughts?

169
00:11:24,039 --> 00:11:25,320
Every time Lady Feng leaves the palace,

170
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,600
she enjoys this dish.

171
00:11:30,039 --> 00:11:31,240
She'd better not

172
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:32,279
complain about it.

173
00:11:49,919 --> 00:11:50,720
[At 7:45 PM,]

174
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:51,960
[meet me ten miles outside the city.]

175
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:53,559
[I have a plan to repel the enemy.]

176
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,080
[We might work together.]

177
00:11:58,000 --> 00:11:58,720
Work together?

178
00:12:31,360 --> 00:12:32,440
Time is running out.

179
00:12:34,519 --> 00:12:36,039
Since we've taken the first step,

180
00:12:36,919 --> 00:12:38,120
we can't stop here.

181
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:40,759
Anybody there?

182
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:42,200
Is anyone there?

183
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:43,279
I want to see His Majesty.

184
00:12:57,159 --> 00:12:57,799
You're back.

185
00:12:58,679 --> 00:12:59,480
How did you get out?

186
00:13:01,759 --> 00:13:02,320
No need to ask.

187
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:04,519
It must be Shen Li.

188
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:07,000
Does he really think I wouldn't dare to kill him?

189
00:13:09,919 --> 00:13:11,200
If so,

190
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:12,759
will you kill him?

191
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:19,080
I was going to ask the guard

192
00:13:19,159 --> 00:13:19,759
to look for you,

193
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:21,000
but Shen Li just happened to come over.

194
00:13:21,519 --> 00:13:22,120
He told me

195
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:23,559
you had something to do outside the palace tonight.

196
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:24,960
But I couldn't wait any longer,

197
00:13:25,080 --> 00:13:26,440
so I sneaked out to find you.

198
00:13:26,799 --> 00:13:27,399
Where have you been?

199
00:13:29,559 --> 00:13:30,039
Ye Xuan,

200
00:13:31,039 --> 00:13:32,600
how about making a deal with me?

201
00:13:39,440 --> 00:13:40,039
I...

202
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:45,399
What tricks are you playing?

203
00:13:47,799 --> 00:13:48,799
I like the food

204
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:49,519
you prepared for me.

205
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:51,440
But you can't just care about

206
00:13:51,480 --> 00:13:52,600
whether I eat well or not.

207
00:13:52,919 --> 00:13:54,200
You're not made of iron.

208
00:13:54,519 --> 00:13:55,799
Do me a favor and eat something.

209
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:07,639
Come on.

210
00:14:14,159 --> 00:14:15,279
Are you still angry?

211
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:17,000
Forget it.

212
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:19,039
I understand you.

213
00:14:19,279 --> 00:14:20,559
I'll come back

214
00:14:20,679 --> 00:14:21,399
when you calm down.

215
00:14:28,879 --> 00:14:29,879
I'm a man.

216
00:14:30,240 --> 00:14:30,960
Logically,

217
00:14:31,440 --> 00:14:32,879
I should be the first to make peace.

218
00:14:43,200 --> 00:14:44,360
I went out of the palace a few days ago,

219
00:14:45,279 --> 00:14:46,360
and bought you a hairpin.

220
00:14:46,919 --> 00:14:47,360
Wait for me.

221
00:14:55,519 --> 00:14:56,600
What did you put

222
00:14:58,480 --> 00:14:59,519
in the wine?

223
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:03,600
Something that can make you

224
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:04,799
have a good sleep.

225
00:15:05,799 --> 00:15:06,320
Yue Xuan,

226
00:15:07,519 --> 00:15:08,120
I'm sorry.

227
00:15:17,279 --> 00:15:18,320
Feng Zhiwei,

228
00:15:19,879 --> 00:15:21,000
why?

229
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:25,200
Why does it have to be Gu Jiachen?

230
00:15:26,799 --> 00:15:28,559
I met you six years ago,

231
00:15:28,600 --> 00:15:29,440
too.

232
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:33,120
I also remember everything

233
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:34,440
that happened between us.

234
00:15:35,360 --> 00:15:36,240
I

235
00:15:37,480 --> 00:15:39,399
have always been by your side.

236
00:15:41,639 --> 00:15:42,720
But why

237
00:15:44,720 --> 00:15:45,879
don't you

238
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:50,000
ever see me?

239
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:55,159
Why don't you even

240
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:56,159
leave me a way out?

241
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:09,759
Yexuan,

242
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:11,159
don't be afraid.

243
00:16:13,559 --> 00:16:14,559
It will be over soon.

244
00:16:16,759 --> 00:16:17,679
Over?

245
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:22,120
Over?

246
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:25,840
Are you okay?

247
00:16:26,480 --> 00:16:28,200
If I don't perform well,

248
00:16:29,399 --> 00:16:30,159
how can I live up to

249
00:16:30,240 --> 00:16:31,679
your efforts just now?

250
00:16:34,600 --> 00:16:35,440
Do you know

251
00:16:37,559 --> 00:16:39,240
how happy I was just now?

252
00:16:42,240 --> 00:16:44,039
I thought you finally saw me.

253
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:47,279
You pretended to be tender,

254
00:16:47,639 --> 00:16:49,080
but you still wanted to kill me.

255
00:16:49,559 --> 00:16:50,120
Ye Xuan.

256
00:16:50,559 --> 00:16:51,320
Let me go.

257
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:52,759
I just want everything

258
00:16:52,759 --> 00:16:53,799
to get back on track.

259
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:57,799
From now on,

260
00:16:59,440 --> 00:17:01,159
you should stay by my side.

261
00:17:03,159 --> 00:17:04,519
You should be with me every day.

262
00:17:05,279 --> 00:17:06,519
Don't go anywhere.
